YO HOWSURDOIN 0.1

IWANNACOMENT:
COSSERT TIC TAC TOE
TWO HUMAN PLAYERS
X GOES FIRST
THIS PROGRAM INTENTIONALLY USES ONLY THE COSSERT RULES WE HAVE DEFINED
COMENT FINISH

HAV A LIST "board" LIKE ["0", "1", "2", "3", "4", "5", "6", "7", "8"]:

GET "turn" LETITB "X"
GET "move" LETITB 0
GET "cell" LETITB ""
GET "movesMade" LETITB 0
GET "newCount" LETITB 0
GET "won" LETITB 0
GET "oldTurn" LETITB ""
GET "ignore" LETITB 0

IWANNACOMENT:
SHOWBOARD TAKES EACH CELL OUT, SAVES IT,
PUTS IT BACK INTO THE SAME SLOT,
THEN BUILDS THREE ROW STRINGS.
TAKITOUT NEVER SHIFTS THE OTHER IDS.
COMENT FINISH

ELLO "SHOWBOARD" YOUR NOW DOIN {

    GET "b0" LETITB TAKITOUT{board}[0]
    GET "b1" LETITB TAKITOUT{board}[1]
    GET "b2" LETITB TAKITOUT{board}[2]
    GET "b3" LETITB TAKITOUT{board}[3]
    GET "b4" LETITB TAKITOUT{board}[4]
    GET "b5" LETITB TAKITOUT{board}[5]
    GET "b6" LETITB TAKITOUT{board}[6]
    GET "b7" LETITB TAKITOUT{board}[7]
    GET "b8" LETITB TAKITOUT{board}[8]

    UREPLACEIT{board}[0] W/b0
    UREPLACEIT{board}[1] W/b1
    UREPLACEIT{board}[2] W/b2
    UREPLACEIT{board}[3] W/b3
    UREPLACEIT{board}[4] W/b4
    UREPLACEIT{board}[5] W/b5
    UREPLACEIT{board}[6] W/b6
    UREPLACEIT{board}[7] W/b7
    UREPLACEIT{board}[8] W/b8

    GET "r0a" LETITB YO COMBINE b0 W/" | "
    GET "r0b" LETITB YO COMBINE r0a W/b1
    GET "r0c" LETITB YO COMBINE r0b W/" | "
    GET "row0" LETITB YO COMBINE r0c W/b2

    GET "r1a" LETITB YO COMBINE b3 W/" | "
    GET "r1b" LETITB YO COMBINE r1a W/b4
    GET "r1c" LETITB YO COMBINE r1b W/" | "
    GET "row1" LETITB YO COMBINE r1c W/b5

    GET "r2a" LETITB YO COMBINE b6 W/" | "
    GET "r2b" LETITB YO COMBINE r2a W/b7
    GET "r2c" LETITB YO COMBINE r2b W/" | "
    GET "row2" LETITB YO COMBINE r2c W/b8

    SPITOUT("")
    SPITOUT(row0)
    SPITOUT("--+---+--")
    SPITOUT(row1)
    SPITOUT("--+---+--")
    SPITOUT(row2)
    SPITOUT("")

    FINALANSER(0)
}

IWANNACOMENT:
CHECKWIN READS THE BOARD THE COSSERT WAY:
TAKE EVERYTHING OUT, THEN RESTORE EVERYTHING.
THEN IT CHECKS ALL EIGHT POSSIBLE WINNING LINES.
NO ELSE IF EXISTS BECAUSE COSSERT DOES NOT BELIEVE IN CONVENIENCE.
COMENT FINISH

ELLO "CHECKWIN" YOUR NOW DOIN {

    GET "c0" LETITB TAKITOUT{board}[0]
    GET "c1" LETITB TAKITOUT{board}[1]
    GET "c2" LETITB TAKITOUT{board}[2]
    GET "c3" LETITB TAKITOUT{board}[3]
    GET "c4" LETITB TAKITOUT{board}[4]
    GET "c5" LETITB TAKITOUT{board}[5]
    GET "c6" LETITB TAKITOUT{board}[6]
    GET "c7" LETITB TAKITOUT{board}[7]
    GET "c8" LETITB TAKITOUT{board}[8]

    UREPLACEIT{board}[0] W/c0
    UREPLACEIT{board}[1] W/c1
    UREPLACEIT{board}[2] W/c2
    UREPLACEIT{board}[3] W/c3
    UREPLACEIT{board}[4] W/c4
    UREPLACEIT{board}[5] W/c5
    UREPLACEIT{board}[6] W/c6
    UREPLACEIT{board}[7] W/c7
    UREPLACEIT{board}[8] W/c8

    HMM WATIF(c0 == turn)
        HMM WATIF(c1 == turn)
            HMM WATIF(c2 == turn)
                FINALANSER(1)

    HMM WATIF(c3 == turn)
        HMM WATIF(c4 == turn)
            HMM WATIF(c5 == turn)
                FINALANSER(1)

    HMM WATIF(c6 == turn)
        HMM WATIF(c7 == turn)
            HMM WATIF(c8 == turn)
                FINALANSER(1)

    HMM WATIF(c0 == turn)
        HMM WATIF(c3 == turn)
            HMM WATIF(c6 == turn)
                FINALANSER(1)

    HMM WATIF(c1 == turn)
        HMM WATIF(c4 == turn)
            HMM WATIF(c7 == turn)
                FINALANSER(1)

    HMM WATIF(c2 == turn)
        HMM WATIF(c5 == turn)
            HMM WATIF(c8 == turn)
                FINALANSER(1)

    HMM WATIF(c0 == turn)
        HMM WATIF(c4 == turn)
            HMM WATIF(c8 == turn)
                FINALANSER(1)

    HMM WATIF(c2 == turn)
        HMM WATIF(c4 == turn)
            HMM WATIF(c6 == turn)
                FINALANSER(1)

    FINALANSER(0)
}

SPITOUT("================================")
SPITOUT("       COSSERT TIC TAC TOE")
SPITOUT("================================")
SPITOUT("Player X goes first.")
SPITOUT("Choose a board ID from 0 to 8.")
SPITOUT("")

GET "ignore" LETITB SHOWBOARD()

IWANNACOMENT:
THE OUTER LOOP IS DELIBERATELY LONG.
BAD INPUT OR A TAKEN SQUARE USES SKIPTIS,
SO A FAILED ATTEMPT DOES NOT HAVE TO END THE GAME.
THE GAME ENDS WITH FRGETABTIT WHEN SOMEONE WINS OR THE BOARD IS FULL.
COMENT FINISH

GOAROUND 100 TIMES:

    SPITOUT("CURRENT PLAYER:")
    SPITOUT(turn)

    YO USER DILE("Choose square 0-8: "): move

    HMM WATIF(move < 0)
        SPITOUT("NOPE. IDs START AT 0.")
        SKIPTIS

    HMM WATIF(move > 8)
        SPITOUT("NOPE. IDs END AT 8.")
        SKIPTIS

    "cell" CHANGETO-> TAKITOUT{board}[move]

    IWANNACOMENT:
    AN UNUSED CELL STILL CONTAINS ITS ORIGINAL NUMBER.
    A USED CELL CONTAINS X OR O.
    COMENT FINISH

    HMM WATIF(cell == "X")
        UREPLACEIT{board}[move] W/cell
        SPITOUT("THAT SQUARE IS ALREADY X.")
        SKIPTIS

    HMM WATIF(cell == "O")
        UREPLACEIT{board}[move] W/cell
        SPITOUT("THAT SQUARE IS ALREADY O.")
        SKIPTIS

    UREPLACEIT{board}[move] W/turn

    "newCount" CHANGETO-> YO COMBINE movesMade W/1
    "movesMade" CHANGETO-> newCount

    GET "ignore" LETITB SHOWBOARD()

    "won" CHANGETO-> CHECKWIN()

    HMM WATIF(won == 1)
        SPITOUT("================================")
        SPITOUT("WINNER:")
        SPITOUT(turn)
        SPITOUT("COSSERT HAS DECLARED VICTORY.")
        SPITOUT("================================")
        FRGETABTIT

    HMM WATIF(movesMade == 9)
        SPITOUT("================================")
        SPITOUT("DRAW.")
        SPITOUT("NOBODY WON. THE BOARD SURVIVED.")
        SPITOUT("================================")
        FRGETABTIT

    "oldTurn" CHANGETO-> turn

    HMM WATIF(oldTurn == "X")
        "turn" CHANGETO-> "O"

    HMM WATIF(oldTurn == "O")
        "turn" CHANGETO-> "X"

OKALFINEBYE
